{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","pagetitle":"Start a project","description":"Tell EliOra about the manual report, disconnected data, or decision workflow you want to improve.","format":"html"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<main class=\"site-page page-contact\" id=\"main-content\" data-page=\"contact\">\n<section class=\"page-hero section-grid\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Start a project</p><h1 id=\"contact-title\">Tell us what slows<br><em>your team down.</em></h1></div><p class=\"page-hero-lead\">Describe the manual report, disconnected data, or decision workflow you want to improve. We will start with the problem, not a prepackaged product.</p></section>\n\n<section class=\"contact-layout section-grid\"><div class=\"contact-context\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">A useful first message</p><h2>Bring the workflow<br><em>as it is.</em></h2><p>You do not need a polished brief. Tell us what repeats, where the handoffs happen, and what a clearer next move would make possible.</p><div class=\"contact-route\"><span>01</span><span>Describe the friction</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>02</span><span>Find the signal</span></div></div><div class=\"contact-form-wrap\"><form id=\"contact-form\" action=\"https://formspree.io/f/mwpqavvz\" method=\"POST\"><div class=\"form-field\"><label for=\"name\">Name <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" required aria-describedby=\"name-hint\"><p id=\"name-hint\" class=\"field-hint\">Required.</p></div><div class=\"form-field\"><label for=\"email\">Work email <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required aria-describedby=\"email-hint\"><p id=\"email-hint\" class=\"field-hint\">Required. We use it only to respond to your inquiry.</p></div><div class=\"form-field\"><label for=\"organization\">Organization <span class=\"optional\">Optional</span></label><input id=\"organization\" name=\"organization\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"organization\"></div><div class=\"form-field\"><label for=\"message\">What are you trying to improve? <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"6\" required aria-describedby=\"message-hint\"></textarea><p id=\"message-hint\" class=\"field-hint\">Required. A few sentences is enough.</p></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"subject\" value=\"New project inquiry from EliOra Tech Solutions\"><div class=\"honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"_gotcha\">Leave this field empty</label><input id=\"_gotcha\" name=\"_gotcha\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"form-submit\"><button class=\"button button-primary\" type=\"submit\">Send inquiry <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><p id=\"form-status\" class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></div><p class=\"privacy-note\">We use the information you send only to respond to your inquiry.</p></form></div></section>\n</main>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<main class=\"site-page page-contact\" id=\"main-content\" data-page=\"contact\">\n<section class=\"page-hero section-grid\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Start a project</p><h1 id=\"contact-title\">Tell us what slows<br><em>your team down.</em></h1></div><p class=\"page-hero-lead\">Describe the manual report, disconnected data, or decision workflow you want to improve. We will start with the problem, not a prepackaged product.</p></section>\n\n<section class=\"contact-layout section-grid\"><div class=\"contact-context\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">A useful first message</p><h2>Bring the workflow<br><em>as it is.</em></h2><p>You do not need a polished brief. Tell us what repeats, where the handoffs happen, and what a clearer next move would make possible.</p><div class=\"contact-route\"><span>01</span><span>